        <p>Most asset registries are static — untouched since commissioning. Asset Intelligence keeps the record current: every inspection and work order touchpoint updates the asset profile.</p>
        <p>That profile includes asset hierarchy, condition and performance history, criticality scoring, location, photos, and a live compliance status. It's the layer every other Assetas module reads from and writes to.</p>
      </div>
